[TITLE]
CON-02: storage unit S1, a 2 ft x 2 ft wet well (constant area 4 ft2, 10 ft deep),
no outlet; 0.05 cfs for 10 min (30 ft3), then nothing. MIN_SURFAREA is the default
(12.566 ft2). S1 should end holding the 30 ft3 at 7.5 ft.
J1-C1-O1 is only there because SWMM needs an outfall.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             00:20:00
REPORT_STEP          00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP         5
VARIABLE_STEP        0

[JUNCTIONS]
J1     0    5        0         0        0

[OUTFALLS]
O1     -1   FREE

[STORAGE]
;;Name Elev MaxD InitD Shape     A1 A2 A0   SurDepth Fevap
S1     0    10   0     FUNCTIONAL 0  0  4    0        0

[CONDUITS]
C1     J1  O1  100  0.013  0  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
S1  FLOW  TS1  FLOW 1.0 1.0 0

[TIMESERIES]
TS1  0:00  0.05
TS1  0:10  0.05
TS1  0:10:01  0
TS1  0:20  0

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
